<title>FRANCE: EU cuts daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU cuts daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut the daily refund applying to soft wheat exports to Switzerland, Liechstenstein and the Spanish territories of Ceuta and Melilla to two Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 7.50 Ecus, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The EU also cut the refund on barley exports to the same destinations to 15.00 ecus per tonne from 20.50 ecus.</p>
<p>The refund on rye exports was kept unchanged at 22.00 Ecus per tonne. --Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
